m text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en"><p>Videos will be judged based on [criteria, e.g. creativity, originality, and relevance to the theme]. The decision of the judges is final and binding.</p></div></div><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1677804538615" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1677804538615"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">Prizes:</h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1677804576331" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1677804576331"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en"><p>The winner will receive $500 CityLocs Gift Card. The prize is non-transferable and cannot be redeemed for cash.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Notification of winner:</strong> The winner will be notified via Email.<br><br><i>Use of videos:</i> By entering the contest, participants grant the contest sponsor the right to use videos for [purposes, e.g. promotional purposes on social media and the sponsor's website].</p><p><br></p><p>By entering the contest, participants agree to be bound by these rules.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1678469104781" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1678469104781"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h4 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">Follow these guidelines & tips to create a successful video!&nbsp;</h4></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1678235282370" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1678235282370" data-layout-lg="3+3+3+3" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="3+3+3+3" data-layout-sm="6+6+6+6" data-layout-xs="12+12+12+12"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-3 gf_col-md-3 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1678235282478" data-id="1678235282478"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1678236459950" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1678236459950" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/033138a7-14e8-4ceb-b0eb-d6d4b602b953/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/well-lit-icon.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" width="1000" height="1000" data-width="125px" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="1000" natural-height="1000"></div></div><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1678478400063" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1678478400063"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h5 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><span style="color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">Lighting is everything!</span></h5></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1678236471457" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1678236471457"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>Position yourself in a well-lit area and avoid bright lights behind you, as this can cause overexposure and make you look washed out. Opt for lighting that flatters your features, making sure you look your best on camera and effectively convey your message.</p></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-3 gf_col-md-3 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1678235296918" data-id="1678235296918">